 reigned at the top of los  angeles underworld he survived 11  assassination attempts according to him  and even enjoyed a few years of peace  and quiet following his release from  prison and that was a lot more than what  most of its associates got  thanks again to enlisted for sponsoring  today's video head to enlisted dot link  forward slash biographics enlisted to  get started you get three free days of  premium time and some bonus troops and  weapons link below go check them out and  thanks for watching

